---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About — The Makers Collective | Waiheke Island Art & Prints"
  description="The story behind The Makers Collective, a group of Waiheke Island artists selling original work and prints online."
>
  <section class="wrap about">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
    <h1>Made slowly, on an island that rewards slowness.</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      Waiheke is a 40-minute ferry ride from Auckland and a world away from
      it — vineyards on the hillsides, olive groves running down to rocky
      bays, and a community of makers who've built their practice around
      the island's light and pace rather than in spite of it.
    </p>

    <p>
      The Makers Collective began as a shared studio wall: a handful of
      painters and printmakers on Waiheke who wanted a way to sell directly,
      without splitting their work across galleries on the mainland. What
      you see here is that wall, online — every piece made by hand, on the
      island, by someone you could actually meet at the Saturday market.
    </p>

    <p>
      We keep the collective small on purpose. Every original is sold once.
      Every print run is limited and numbered. When a piece is gone, it's
      gone — that's not a sales tactic, it's just how the work is made.
    </p>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <h2>Buying from the collective</h2>
    <p>
      When you buy an original, we handle shipping and any framing questions
      directly with you after checkout, in coordination with the artist who
      made the piece. Prints ship rolled in a protective tube, ready to
      frame. Both ship from Waiheke, worldwide.
    </p>

    <a href="/gallery" class="btn btn-solid">Browse the gallery</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about { padding: 3rem 0 4rem; max-width: 68ch; }
  .about h1 { margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .lede { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .about h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .about .btn { margin-top: 1rem; }
</style>
